      "side": 1,
      "message": "Michal and I have run into it, both with the Apple 3-in-1 dongle which can hit this when it presents the wrong data role after hard resets.  Theoretically, I wouldn\u0027t expect many interop failures since we had this running in TCPMv1 for quite a while and wild ChromeOS devices are still majority TCPMv1.  It just got missed in TCPMv2.\n\nThe only other device I\u0027ve seen us hit this with on TCPMv1 was a Zinger EVT charger.  It sent its Source Cap as a PD 1.0 UFP",
